# Template for ~/.setup-secrets on CT 120 (mode 600). setup-hermes.sh sources
# this, writes the keys into Hermes' .env, then deletes the file. Values are a
# subset of pve:/root/lab-secrets.env — copy them in before provisioning.
# Real values NEVER go in git. This file lists only the names the script reads.
